# The repository root is the build context for ml/Dockerfile. Keep runtime
# corpora, checkpoints and database dumps out of ACR task uploads. The image
# needs only ETL and ML source; all models are mounted at runtime.
*
!etl/
!ml/

etl/.venv/
ml/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
